<law>
	<structure>
		<unit label="title" identifier="17.1" level="1">Courts of Record</unit>
		<unit label="chapter" identifier="6" level="2">Costs Generally</unit>
	</structure>
	<section_number>17.1-624</section_number>
	<catch_line>Who to tax costs</catch_line>
	<text>
		The clerk of the court wherein any party recovers costs shall tax the same.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 14-193; 1952, c. 616; 1954, c. 99; 1964, c. 386, § 14.1-196; 1984, c. 703; 1998, c. 872; 2014, c. 315.</history>
</law>
